# Files Wrangler must NOT upload as public static assets.
#
# wrangler.jsonc sets assets.directory to "." — the whole repository. Cloudflare
# Pages used to exclude .git automatically; Workers does NOT, so without this
# file https://iconicmach.com/.git/config was publicly readable and the entire
# git history (including every past version of every file) could be cloned by
# anyone. It also meant ~890 extra files and ~139 MB uploaded on every deploy.
#
# Syntax is the same as .gitignore.

# --- version control: the serious one ---------------------------------------
.git
.github

# --- build tooling and source: no reason to be public -----------------------
.claude
scripts
content
*.py
CLAUDE.md
SETUP.md
wrangler.jsonc
.assetsignore

# --- editor / OS noise ------------------------------------------------------
node_modules
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.code-workspace
.vscode
.idea

# Everything else is the site itself and must stay:
#   index.html, 404.html, en/, ar/, assets/, robots.txt, sitemap.xml,
#   site.webmanifest, _headers
